## Codex
- Skills: `$task-flow:task <TASK-ID>`, `$task-flow:decompose <input>`,
  `$task-flow:ci-gate`, `$prediction-protocol:prediction-protocol`.
- Sandbox `workspace-write`: `.git/` is read-only and the network is off inside
  it — `git commit` / `git push` escalate through `.codex/rules/git.rules`.
- Under the prediction protocol a one-way command without a receipt is denied,
  not asked: open the receipt (`predict open …`), then repeat the command.
